---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PrivacyHero from "../../components/Privacy/PrivacyHero.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy and Data Protection at Mahakali Home Furnitures & Interiors."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <main class="privacy-page">
    <PrivacyHero 
      title="Privacy Policy" 
      subtitle="We value your privacy. Read about how we collect, use, and protect your personal information."
    />
    
    <section class="policy-section wrap section">
      <div class="policy-container">
        <h2 class="font-display">Privacy Policy</h2>
        
        <ol class="privacy-list">
          <li>We collect customer details such as name, phone number, address, and email to process and deliver orders.</li>
          <li>Customer data is stored securely and used only for communication and invoicing purposes.</li>
          <li>Payment information such as card or UPI details is processed through secure third-party payment gateways. Mahakali does not store any financial details.</li>
          <li>We may send SMS/WhatsApp/email promotions to customers for new offers. Customers may request to opt out anytime.</li>
          <li>We may use cookies to improve user experience, enhance website functionality, and track visitor patterns.</li>
          <li>We do not sell, rent, or distribute any personal information to external companies except logistics/delivery partners.</li>
          <li>Any personal details shared during customer support interactions (calls, messages, or chats) are used only for resolving queries and improving services.</li>
          <li>We may collect non-personal analytical data such as browser type, device information, pages visited, and session duration to improve website performance.</li>
          <li>Customer data may be shared with service providers such as installation teams, warranty service partners, or support agents, strictly for order-related services.</li>
          <li>In case of legal requirements or government requests, we may disclose information as mandated by law.</li>
          <li>Reviews, feedback, or testimonials shared by customers may be displayed on the website or social media platforms, with or without minimal identification (name and city).</li>
          <li>Users below the age of 18 should use the website only under the supervision of a parent or guardian.</li>
          <li>If any changes are made to our Privacy Policy, they will be updated on this page. Continued use of the website implies acceptance of revised policies.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .policy-section {
    padding-top: 5rem;
    padding-bottom: 8rem;
  }
  .policy-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    padding: 3rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .policy-container {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
  
  .policy-container h2 {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-line);
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .policy-container ol.privacy-list {
    list-style-type: decimal;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }
  
  .policy-container li {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
</style>
